message: "If you use this software or the adjudicated OPT-175B interruption trace, please cite it as below."
title: "LLM Training Reliability: Failure Analysis & Checkpoint Optimization"
abstract: >-
  Survival analysis of public GPU-cluster failure data (Meta OPT-175B logbook, Shanghai AI Lab Acme
  traces, Alibaba PAI trace) and trace-driven evaluation of checkpoint-interval policies
  (Young, Daly, online Daly, Weibull hazard-adaptive) for distributed LLM training.
